WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:04.560
Considering the current state of
affairs, there are many people

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:08.460
who have asked or have suggested
or have wondered how it is

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:14.730
exactly that you can be a
conservative rebel or a rebel in

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:19.380
a time when a system is becoming
tyrannical. And so I thought

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:23.820
that we could look at how
exactly you can do that. And the

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:28.080
best way to look at that
question is, of course, to look

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.680
at the story of King David. In
the story of King David we will

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:36.270
find some very surprising
imagery, some very surprising

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:42.210
use of symbolism that will help
us understand when it is that we

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:46.440
have to be something like the
snake that avoids being caught

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:51.750
or something like the person who
is dancing around the tyrannical

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:52.320
system.

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:24.180
So in the story of King David,
King Saul represents very much

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:28.800
the tyrannical king. And you can
see that he represents the

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:33.450
tyrannical king because the
reason why God has displeased

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:38.310
with him is because King Saul
tries to take the sacrifice upon

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:43.650
himself. That is, he tries to
act as the spiritual authority,

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:46.350
to take away the power from the
spiritual authority and

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:50.880
sacrifice before the prophet
arrives, who's the one who's

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.150
supposed to do the sacrifice.
The other place where King Saul

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:59.940
disappoints is when he does not
obey the rule that God gives.

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:03.960
Now, that rule is a very, very
dark and extreme rule that he

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:08.370
receives from God. And one day
we'll look at what that is

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:11.340
talking about. But for now, it's
mostly important to understand

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:14.760
that in the story, the reason
why he's seen as a tyrannical

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:17.820
king is that he wants to
concentrate power in himself,

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:21.480
take it away from the prophet,
and ultimately you could say,

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:27.210
even, let's say, think that he
can decide instead of God.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:30.990
And so because Saul is a
tyrannical king, then the

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:35.310
prophet Samuel will anoint
David, God will tell Samuel to

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:39.840
anointed David to be the
replacement of King Saul. Now,

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:45.990
at the outset, King David is
hidden. It is not public, that

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:52.230
he is the future king. At the
moment, he is hidden, he is the

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:56.460
secret king. And as the secret
King, it will become necessary

00:02:56.460 --> 00:03:01.260
for him to actually resist the
tyranny of King Saul. Now,

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:06.630
what's really interesting is to
notice to what extent King David

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:13.740
takes on the role, takes on
images of all that is dark, all

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:19.980
that is shifty, all that is
strange, all that is insane. He

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:24.570
takes on all that symbolism, in
the moment when he is resisting

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:29.880
King Saul. And so it really is a
perspective, from the point of

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:32.610
view of someone who wants to
resist the system and in order

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:37.620
to do so, must take the role of
that on which the system is

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:41.820
trying to rule or that which is
the kind of bubbling chaos,

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:47.430
which is at the bottom of the
world. Now. This starts with the

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:53.220
very image of the fact that the
way that David was inserted into

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:57.690
King Saul's court was that he
was asked to come sing for King

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:00.600
Saul. Now, if you read my
brother's book, you will see

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:04.140
that the fact that you have the
king standing there, and then

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:09.750
you have King David who is
playing music, trying to calm

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:14.040
down the king's ardour, trying
to soothe him. And you'll see

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:17.370
that at first he does soothe
him. At the outset, King David

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:21.540
plays music for the king and
soothes the character. So you

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:24.510
can actually see interestingly
enough, King David playing the

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:31.170
role of the jester, the
entertainer, the moment when

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:36.720
work stops, entertainment, all
of that in order to act as a

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:42.990
counterpoint to the excess of
the tyrannical king. But then

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:49.320
once King Saul is going to start
to be jealous of King David,

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:53.580
because you have that moment
when King David kills Goliath.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:59.040
And so, King Saul becomes
jealous of David and so now

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:02.370
starts to look out for him. And
this is where you're going to

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:04.680
see some very interesting
symbolism.

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:09.910
Now, once again, David is
standing there and he's playing

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:15.730
music for King Saul. And so he
represents all that is related

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:18.070
to time. For example, in
Matthieu's book, all that is

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:24.220
related to the informal, to the,
let's say, unnamed or something

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:27.610
which is not fixed, something
which is moving, something which

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:34.630
is rhythmic. And what does King
Saul try to do? He tries to jab

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:41.290
David with his lance, and tries,
by that, to pin him to the wall.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:44.170
That's what it says in
Scripture. And so you can

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:49.660
understand that King Saul's
desire to jab David, right, to

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:54.700
pierce him with a lance, is akin
to something like, you know,

00:05:54.730 --> 00:06:01.900
pinning an insect down into a
display case. He's trying to fix

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:05.650
him. He's trying to stop him
from playing music. He's trying

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:09.760
to stop him from being that
shifty character. He wants to

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:15.460
name him. And now in this image,
we see the negative aspect of

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:20.110
naming. That is that there is an
aspect of naming which, if we're

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:24.910
not careful about naming, can
utterly fix something, can

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:29.440
prevent it from having its
malleability, its idiosyncrasy,

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:33.580
right, too much light, too much
identity can be a very dangerous

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:38.740
thing, because it can freeze
something, can freeze it into

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:42.820
death. And you can see that with
people who are, you know, too

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:46.930
obsessed with naming, too
obsessed with control, is that

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:50.650
if you exercise too much control
over a system, then you can

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:55.630
actually cripple it into
immobility. You can kill it by

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:59.890
piercing it. And so, it's very
fascinating to see that King

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:03.880
Saul wants to jab David, and
that this is related to fixing

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:08.740
him, to, you could say something
like, stopping him from moving,

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:13.150
totally identifying him, totally
capturing David, you know, like,

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:18.910
as if he was a wild animal. As
if he was something that he's

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:22.750
hunting, right, to hunt him
down, to find him, to fix him.

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:28.180
And this is now an image of the
tyrannical state or the

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:34.030
tyrannical king then wants to
fully master. And in that

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:37.870
mastery try to kill it. It has
something to do with, I've

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:41.920
talked about the notion of the
system of the beast or the the

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:45.940
excess of naming, which comes in
all that imagery of 666

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:49.600
symbolism and the idea of
marking something. Marking it in

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:53.080
a manner that is complete, so
that there is no remainder,

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:58.180
trying to make it so that there
is absolutely no remainder, that

00:07:58.180 --> 00:08:00.850
everything is captured by the
system.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:04.890
Now, of course, in our case,
this can be completely related

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:08.520
to technocratic societies, to
societies of surveillance,

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:13.800
societies of tracking. And we
can see how right now this is

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:19.770
being very much accelerated by
the state trying to jab us and

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:23.070
trying to jab us in a way that
fixes us, and makes us

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:27.930
participate in a system of
naming in which there should not

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:32.130
be any remainder. And this is
why there's so much obsession

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:36.570
with making sure everybody is
part of the system, you know,

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:39.360
and so this is what is happening
around us. So it's interesting

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:45.420
to see the manner in which David
resists this. Now, this is some

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:48.960
of the craziest symbolism that
you'll ever see. Because once

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:54.900
David, who is the future king,
the king in hiding becomes a,

00:08:55.530 --> 00:09:00.600
let's say, becomes a target for
the tyrannical system, then

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:05.430
David will take on all the
symbolism of the opposite, all

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:09.240
the symbolism of the strange, of
the enemy and of madness. And

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:14.070
this of course, interestingly
enough, starts with a moment

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:19.530
where King David's isn't sure
whether or not Saul is really

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:21.960
angry with him and whether or
not Saul still wants to kill

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:26.340
him. So after David runs away,
you know, when Saul tries to pin

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:29.520
him to the wall, he comes back,
and then he speaks to his friend

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:35.070
Jonathan. And he asks Jonathan
like, you know, what's the

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:39.510
situation and Jonathan is
telling him, "I'm going to go

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:46.140
back to see my father, and you
stay here. And so if my father

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:50.340
asks for you, that is, if he
asked for you in an angry way,

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:53.580
that is, if he wants to know
where you are. If he wants to

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:56.130
make sure he knows where you
are, that you've been properly

00:09:56.130 --> 00:10:00.000
tracked, then it means that
you're in danger. If he's angry

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:03.480
that you're not there that he
wants you to be in his court,

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:07.380
then you'll know that you're in
danger. But if it doesn't bother

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:10.260
him that you're not fully in his
court, that you're not there at

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:14.010
this moment, then we'll know
that you're not in danger. So

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:17.850
Jonathan goes back and then
realises that King Saul gets

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:21.090
very angry because David is not
there. But what's interesting is

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:26.910
the sign that Jonathan gives to
David. So he says, "When I come

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:31.590
back, you're going to hide next
to a target and then I'm going

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:37.140
to shoot an arrow, right, I'm
going to miss the target. And

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:42.780
the manner in which I miss the
target is going to be a symbol,

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:45.750
it's going to be an image of
what you need to do, whether you

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:48.390
should come back or whether you
should go away." Now this is

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:51.420
extremely interesting if you
understand the notion of

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:55.470
transgression. If you understand
the notion of sin, that here in

00:10:55.470 --> 00:11:00.570
this situation, missing the
target, not hitting the mark, is

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:03.990
the manner in which the shifty
character that David now

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:09.840
represents, you know, the kind
of wild character that he's

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:15.390
becoming, is to know what to do.
And so you can understand what's

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:19.620
going on that things are really,
David is really representing

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:26.460
now, in a very strange way,
something like the dragon that

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:29.850
is avoiding to be pierced by
Saint Michael, but here in this

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:34.530
case, it's of course David which
is the good. We'll see why he is

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:39.720
the good in this case, and why
he's not the same type of dragon

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:42.300
that you see in the icon of
Saint Michael and the dragon,

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.700
but the imagery is the same,
right. Saint Michael is trying

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:48.270
to pierce the dragon, is trying
to fix the dragon. And it's

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:51.540
funny, because a lot of people
have pointed out to me that the

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:56.070
image of Saint Michael, you
know, smashing his lance in the

00:11:56.070 --> 00:12:00.240
dragon's mouth looks like the
COVID test, looks like you're

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.940
receiving a COVID test. And
there's something about that,

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:05.670
there's something intuitive
about the idea of being

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:10.080
penetrated by the state, in a
manner in which they want to do

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:14.850
that in order to make sure that
you're part of their system, and

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:19.170
to kind of make you understand
your position 
vis-à-vis the

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:26.580
state, you know. And so you can
see that, if you think that

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:29.250
that's stretching it, there are
some governments, for example,

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:33.210
the Chinese government, which
allegedly were using other types

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:37.260
of penetrations in order to know
whether or not you had COVID,

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:40.830
which is obviously not necessary
at all, but it can help you

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:44.820
understand what it is that's
going on. That is there is

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:49.860
something which is even
sometimes beyond the people that

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:52.140
are implementing it, that they
don't necessarily - I'm not

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:54.870
saying this is planned to be
this way, but it's still

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:59.490
manifesting a pattern of
penetrating, related to identity

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:02.000
and fixing. It's just there.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:05.960
So what is King David do? Now
King David obviously has to now

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:11.000
run away, and in his running
away, it is so fascinating what

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:18.800
happens. First of all, he has to
hide inside the temple, and in

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:25.310
hiding inside the temple, the
priest ends up giving him the

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:30.650
bread that is in the holy place,
the bread that is for the

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:36.980
priest. And so, you'd say what
is going on? Like what is

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:41.690
happening? And so the priests
are giving him the bread, he is

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:45.560
not taking it for himself.
That's very important. And maybe

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:48.680
say that that's the difference
between him and King Saul, which

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:51.890
is that in a manner David is now
engaging in a form of

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:57.050
transgression. Right, but this
transgression, there's something

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:59.750
innocent about the
transgression. And this is where

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.210
we're going to start to see the
difference. There's something

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:05.960
innocent in his transgression,
but it's not only that, what

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:09.080
does David receive when he goes
into the temple? He receives

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:12.860
Goliath's his sword. Now
receiving Goliath's sword will

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:17.720
be compounded by the fact that
David will then go and associate

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:21.590
himself with the Philistines,
will actually go to the city

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:24.770
from which Goliath comes from,
and will place himself under the

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:30.380
guardianship of the kings and
the people responsible for the

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:31.310
Philistines.

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:38.800
And he pretends to fight for the
enemy. This is very interesting,

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:42.910
but there are other scenes where
he also pretends to be crazy. He

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:52.240
feigns madness. And then in the
wilderness, he assembles in a

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:56.740
cave with a band of debtors and
a band of, you know, shady

00:14:56.740 --> 00:15:01.540
people. And so, these gestures
are all gestures about, you

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:06.490
know, moving into the margin,
going down into the cave, going

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:10.840
into death, aligning yourself
with the stranger, aligning

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:15.250
yourself with your enemy. All of
these things in a way that I've

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:18.700
warned you about that happens on
the periphery. Now this is what

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:24.040
David is doing. And so what is
the difference between David and

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.820
just a traitor? What's the
difference between David and a

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:33.190
regular thief and a regular
debtor? And the answer is

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:39.340
something like his intention.
What is his intention? And how

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:45.160
does that intention play itself
out during the story? Now, this

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:49.360
might seem like it's a trick, or
might seem like it's something

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:52.900
off. But you can see if you look
at the story carefully, you'll

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:57.250
notice for example, when David
is working with the Philistines,

00:15:57.670 --> 00:16:01.210
he makes the Philistines, the
enemies - I forget now if it's

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:03.910
the Philistines, but one of the
enemy tribes of the Israelites -

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:07.060
he pretends that he's fighting
for them, that he's actually

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:11.170
fighting the Israelites, but in
secret he is defending them and

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:16.630
he is doing other things, he's
attacking other tribes while

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:22.210
they think that he's with the
enemy. When he acts crazy he's

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:25.540
actually pretending to be crazy
in order to get away from his

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:29.710
enemy. And then when he comes at
a moment, dark, deep down in the

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:34.540
cave where he's hiding, and then
King Saul comes down in the

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:40.180
cave, and King Saul - This is
one of the most powerful images

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:45.130
of understanding what's going on
in the story. So King Saul goes

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:48.640
down into the cave where David
is hiding. And King Saul doesn't

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:52.270
know David's there. And King
Saul goes there to do his

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:57.340
business. You know, it says to
"cover his feet", you know, and

00:16:57.460 --> 00:17:02.230
while he is down there doing his
business, David sneaks up behind

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:08.170
him while he's going about and
he cuts off the fringe of his

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:11.980
vestment. And then when he
leaves the camp, when Saul

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:17.410
leaves the cave, King David
brandishes the fringe of the

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:24.250
vestment of Saul, as a guarantee
that he is not there to kill the

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:29.800
king, that he has the fringe,
but that he has no intention of

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:34.390
killing the king. So this is
really the difference between

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:42.910
David and a revolutionary. It's
the difference between an Antifa

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:46.780
protest and the trucker convoy.
Look at the differences between

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:50.650
the two. And so, one of them,
let's say, the Antifa protest,

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:58.270
wants to usurp the government,
wants to destroy the power of

00:17:58.270 --> 00:18:03.700
the state, wants to hate
anything about the nation, is

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:07.900
hiding their faces, you know, is
destructive, attacks federal

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:11.500
buildings, does all that. You
saw that in 2020, we saw that

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:14.380
during the Floyd protests.
Antifa attacked federal

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:18.490
buildings in the US for months
on end. If you look at the

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:22.360
trucker convoy protests, what
you have are people waving the

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:26.740
flag of their country, you know,
hundreds of Canadian flags and

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:31.840
hundreds of Quebec flags. And
people basically being extremely

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:34.990
respectful to police, you know,
going up there fist bumping the

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:37.420
police and I've seen them
myself, I was there in Ottawa.

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:41.140
The truckers are extremely
respectful of authority,

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:45.730
extremely respectful of police,
but are saying, "We know this is

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:51.430
edgy, like we know that what
we're doing is maybe

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:56.530
illegitimate in its practice,
but that the intent is we want

00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:01.810
to restore the rule of law, we
want to restore the identity of

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:05.050
our nation." Now you can argue
with them whether or not this is

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:10.900
what ultimately it'll do or not.
And you can argue with them

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:13.540
whether or not you think they're
misguided or that they're in

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:16.690
error, but you can still see the
difference between something

00:19:16.690 --> 00:19:21.040
like a conservative rebel, who
is acting in a rebellious

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:25.780
manner, he is acting in a
technically sinful manner, that

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:30.370
is he's willing to miss the mark
or to avoid the mark in order to

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:35.650
not propagate a tyranny, but
rather point their own country,

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:39.670
their own higher identity
towards a higher purpose.

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:44.460
And so you see that of course
also in the same situation where

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:48.870
King David walks into the camp
while Saul is sleeping, and then

00:19:49.650 --> 00:19:54.210
he find a lance. I think he
actually finds Saul's lance. So

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:57.690
you have a sense in which he
could take that lance and could

00:19:57.690 --> 00:20:02.100
now do the same to Saul, that
Saul tried to do to him; to pin

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:07.050
him to the ground, to stop him
in his tracks, to fix him, but

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:13.410
instead he plants the lance
above Saul's head, and therefore

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:19.290
spares him, and also shows you
exactly what's going on. That

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:25.500
is, that's the difference. Where
are you looking? If you resist

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:28.650
the system you have to be doing
it in a way that's looking above

00:20:28.650 --> 00:20:32.760
the system, that's looking
towards a higher point, a higher

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:37.260
point of attention. You can
resist the system when a system

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:42.630
becomes corrupt as long as you
have your attention towards what

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.970
is right and what is virtuous.
And of course, in a certain

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:49.590
manner, you could say history
will judge you and maybe...

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:54.750
there's a manner in which it's a
tricky position to be in,

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:58.170
because it to a certain extent
you can understand the criticism

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:01.830
of those that do that. But we
see that example in the story of

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:06.240
the church constantly, right. My
own patron saint St. Maximus is

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:11.610
a wonderful example of that,
where St. Maximus thought that

00:21:11.610 --> 00:21:15.840
the emperor was wrong in his
theological pronouncements. And

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:22.080
he said, "No." And the emperor
said, "Look around us. Everybody

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:25.920
agrees with me, the Patriarch of
Constantinople agrees with me,

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:30.270
you know, everybody agrees with
me. Why won't you agree with

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:35.730
me?" And so Maximus said, "No, I
cannot agree with you, I will

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:40.830
not go along with your system."
Because he was looking above he

00:21:40.830 --> 00:21:44.400
was looking higher. And he could
see that there was error in the

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:49.380
way that the emperor was acting
and that the patriarch was

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:53.940
acting. And so like I said, it's
a tricky position to be because

00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:56.790
of a certain extent you also
kind of have to accept the

00:21:56.790 --> 00:22:00.570
consequences of doing that, you
have to accept the consequences

00:22:00.570 --> 00:22:05.910
that if you're going to want to
avoid a tyrannical system, if

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:09.750
you're going to want to point to
a higher meaning. That means

00:22:09.750 --> 00:22:13.170
that you will become the victim
of the system, you know, and

00:22:14.550 --> 00:22:20.160
that's the position we're in
right now. You know, I've

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:23.880
